<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Dashboard | ALGNITION</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/tailwindcss@2.2.19/dist/tailwind.min.css" rel="stylesheet"/>
</head>
<body class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-100 via-blue-100 to-purple-100 font-sans min-h-screen">
  <header class="bg-white shadow-md p-4 sticky top-0 z-50 flex justify-between items-center">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-600">ALGNITION</h1>
    <nav class="space-x-6">
      <a href="/home" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-green-500">Home</a>
      <a href="/insights" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-green-500">Insights</a>
      <!-- <a href="/upload" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-green-500">Upload</a> -->
      <a href="/logout" class="bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md">Logout</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row">
    
    <aside class="bg-white w-full md:w-1/5 p-6 shadow-md">
      <ul class="space-y-4">
        <li><a href="/home" class="block text-green-700 font-semibold hover:text-green-900">Dashboard Overview</a></li>
        <li><a href="#performance" class="block text-gray-700 hover:text-green-600">Performance</a></li>
        <!-- <li><a href="#upload" class="block text-gray-700 hover:text-green-600">Upload Data</a></li> -->
        <!-- <li><a href="#smart-ai" class="block text-gray-700 hover:text-green-600">AI Recommendations</a></li> -->
        <li><a href="/Evaluation" class="block text-gray-700 hover:text-green-600">Evaluation for Travel</a></li>
        <li><a href="/Disease_predictor" class="block text-gray-700 hover:text-green-600">Know Your Disease</a></li>
        <li><a href="/medicine_predictor" class="block text-gray-700 hover:text-green-600">Know Your Medicine</a></li>
        <!-- <li><a href="#settings" class="block text-gray-700 hover:text-green-600">Settings</a></li> -->
      </ul>
    </aside>

    <main class="flex-1 p-8 space-y-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-green-50">
      
      <section class="text-gray-800">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Welcome Back, Innovator! 🚀</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg">Use AI-powered insights to scale your startup faster and smarter.</p>
      </section>

      
      <section id="performance" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-green-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-green-800">Monthly Sales</h3>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2">$0</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-blue-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-blue-800">Site Traffic</h3>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2">0 Visitors</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-purple-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-purple-800">Conversion Rate</h3>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2">0%</p>
        </div>
      </section>

  
     <section id="upload" class="mt-10 relative opacity-60 pointer-events-none">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white bg-opacity-80 z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-lg">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-800">🚀 Coming Soon</h3>
    <p class="text-gray-600 text-center mt-2 px-4">
      The ability to upload and analyze your business data is almost ready. <br/>
      Stay tuned as we unlock this powerful feature!
    </p>
  </div>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Upload Your Business Data</h3>
  <form action="/upload-data" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data"
        class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">

    <div class="mb-4">
      <label class="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-2" for="domain">Business Domain</label>
      <select name="domain" id="domain" required class="w-full p-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md">
        <option value="" disabled selected>Select domain</option>
        <option value="ecommerce">E-Commerce</option>
        <option value="food_delivery">Food Delivery</option>
        <option value="healthcare">Healthcare</option>
        <option value="education">Education</option>
        <option value="retail">Retail</option>
        <option value="other">Other</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-4">
      <label class="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-2" for="targetField">Primary Goal</label>
      <select name="targetField" id="targetField" required class="w-full p-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md">
        <option value="" disabled selected>Select improvement area</option>
        <option value="sales">Sales</option>
        <option value="customer_retention">Customer Retention</option>
        <option value="site_traffic">Site Traffic</option>
        <option value="conversion_rate">Conversion Rate</option>
        <option value="delivery_time">Delivery Time</option>
        <option value="user_engagement">User Engagement</option>
        <option value="other">Other</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-4">
      <label class="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-2" for="customTarget">Describe Your Goal (Optional)</label>
      <input type="text" name="customTarget" id="customTarget"
             placeholder="e.g., Reduce order returns by 15%"
             class="w-full p-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md"/>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-4">
      <label class="block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-2" for="dataFile">Upload Data File</label>
      <input type="file" name="dataFile" id="dataFile" required accept=".csv, .xlsx, .xls"
             class="w-full p-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md"/>
    </div>

  </form>
</section>


      
      <section id="smart-ai" class="mt-10">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-700">🔍 AI Smart Recommendations</h3>
        <div class="bg-white shadow-md p-6 rounded-xl">
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Once your data is analyzed, AI will suggest improvements tailored to your startup’s goals.</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>Predict high-value customer segments.</li>
            <li>Detect sales bottlenecks using ML models.</li>
            <li>Suggest personalized product bundles for upselling.</li>
            <li>Generate automatic marketing strategy outlines.</li>
          </ul>
          <button class="mt-6 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md">
            View Recommendations →
          </button>
        </div>
      </section>

      
      <section id="reports" class="mt-10">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">📄 Recent AI Reports</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
          <li>🧠 Product Suggestions by AI – July 2025</li>
          <li>🚀 Sales Growth Model Evaluation – Q2</li>
          <li>📉 Churn Risk Predictions – Current</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>

  <footer class="bg-white py-6 border-t text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mt-10">
    &copy; 2025 Algnition AI. Empowering Startups with Intelligence.
  </footer>
</body>

</html>
